'' A PROCEDURE-POINTER ALIAS OVER A TYPE ONLY A 'USING' REACHES, used by a file that sorts
'' before the alias's. z.tiko writes 'type OnW as sub( byval p as W ptr )' under 'using
'' host'; a.tiko's 'SetW( ..., byval cb as OnW )' was typed while that using was not yet in
'' effect (ModuleTypedefsFirst_ runs ahead of the walk, which registers usings), so it was
'' DEFINED as SetW(W_*, void(*)(void*)) and the importer called SetW(W_*, void(*)(W_*)):
'' lld-link, undefined symbol (tkDataGrid G1, 2026-11-22). Through a forward alias ('W' for
'' 'W_') and through a plain type ('WP') alike.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/procptrusing/libs tests/modules/src/procptrusing/main.tiko -o tests/modules/procptrusing.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/procptrusing.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7
